Short:    memory bank library
Uploader: cordierfr@wanadoo.fr (Frédéric Cordier)
Author:   cordierfr@wanadoo.fr (Frédéric Cordier)
Type:     util/libs

It's a short library that allow you to use memory bank allocation.
The library assume 128 banks using 4 differents kinds of ram:
	- CHIP
	- PUBLIC
	- FAST
	- 24BITDMAable memory
